				<wikidot:authorName>Dr Reach</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1779895</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Yes.</p> <p>Also, just so this comment is not considered spammy, which it would have been, an observation: Soulless, the ickle lizard had a moment of respite and warmth. Someone gave it to him. And he was, if not happy, at least at peace.</p> <p>Despite everything, he had happiness in his life, before the Foundation came across him. All care given before, all good fortune&#8230; All those satisfying moments beyond his containment&#8230;didn't they count for anything?</p> <p>Didn't he remember the sun, the sand and those delicious bugs?</p> <p><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">And then it became 682 and there was no love no more.</span> Such a beautiful story.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
